Meta.documentation:Number.reciprocate
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Turns each Number into its reciprocal (1/x).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator: each input Number x is emitted as 1/x, exactly.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each Number
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number_default — its reciprocal
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Number:4>>Number.reciprocate:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:0.25
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.divide Number.negate
